{"availability":"available","full":"careerbotdev/careerbot","name":"careerbot","description":"Open-source AI job search assistant. It builds a record of your real work from your own words, then helps you aim, tailor, and apply or write to the people who hire.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T03:30:05Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:23:26Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://careerbot.dev","topics":["agpl","ai","career","convex","job-search","nextjs","open-source","resume","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://careerbot.dev/docs/demo","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:24:59.106Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T10:24:59.106Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T10:24:59.106Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:24:59.106Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2108199081486979229","postId":"2108199081486979229","postedAt":"2026-10-08T14:13:24.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T10:24:59.106Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open-source AI job search assistant. It learns your whole career, points you at the companies and roles where you'll stand out, and gets you ready to apply or to write straight to the people who hire.","You tell CareerBot your career in your own words, job by job. It turns that into a record of what you've done, which you review and approve. You say where you want to go next, or ask it where you could go. It finds companies worth wanting, watches their openings, and tells you which roles deserve your time and why. When you go after one, it writes a tailored resume, cover letter and outreach message from your record, and finds the people to talk to.","Try the demo · careerbot.dev · Docs · Changelog"],"features":["Each line it writes about you shows the facts it's built on, from your own words, and a line with nothing behind it is flagged for you to fix or cut, so you can speak to all of it in an interview.","Nothing enters your record or goes out under your name without your say-so. CareerBot never sends anything: you apply and send every message yourself.","AI spending runs on budgets you set, on your own keys.","It takes real time. Telling the story of a job is often 20 minutes or more. What you get back is a record you can stand behind."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/careerbotdev/careerbot/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"70371387a6ea704c057c80bbfc95c475a80ef97908c7ea9711298619244d9b69","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T07:21:57.760Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:24:59.106Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open-source AI job search assistant. It learns your whole career, points you at the companies and roles where you'll stand out, and gets you ready to apply or to write straight to the people who hire.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/careerbotdev/careerbot/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No account, nothing to set up, and nothing you do there is saved.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/careerbotdev/careerbot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"You bring your own OpenRouter key for the AI and a Convex backend for the data (self-hosted in the same Docker Compose setup, or Convex's free cloud plan).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/careerbotdev/careerbot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open SITEURL ( by default) and create the owner account with the setup code.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/careerbotdev/careerbot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-hosted Convex is upgraded as a step of its own: Upgrading self-hosted Convex.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/careerbotdev/careerbot/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"70371387a6ea704c057c80bbfc95c475a80ef97908c7ea9711298619244d9b